{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 能力仲裁｜流程子图\n受控请求、Can评估与组预留/终检；组规则、输入来源、原激活身份分别唯一归属。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]] · [[计划_AbilitySystem|模块计划]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原完成门禁]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. InputTag / ActionTag定位Spec。\n玩家Process、Boss执行请求点调用TryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary，只进入一次native Try。\nBoss CanActivateAbilityByHandle为QueryOnly预检，无玩家retry来源；真Try仍再准入，不raw回退。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tag",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. final GA::CanActivateAbility。\n独立来源评估→原ActorInfo/GAS/BP/成本/Tag/Mapping检查→组规则→Additional追加业务条件。\n评估封闭后真实失败由ASC final NotifyAbilityFailed消费，Query/raw不借外层来源。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ASC按原组规则仲裁。\nSingleInstance核旧实例可取消性、优先级/平手；Queued只拒占用，Coexist保持。\nControlled Try另核原Busy/活动同实例、来源与支持的实例策略；不复制GAS Active或建立自动激活队列。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "allow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4A. 实际NotifyActivated：GA签Original；ASC分配sequence/登记预留。\nActiveCount++后final Activate：Initialize原批次→原来源重核→Finalize。\n较新pending拒较旧，settled冲突按原取消；终检只看权威组登记。\n完成自己的attempt，原仍有效才相机→Body；不清重入后继。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 216,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "reject",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4B. final NotifyAbilityFailed。\n消费本次独立Can来源→原GAS/GA反馈；只有真实Queued且原来源有效才发OnAbilityInputRetryable(const完整Retry)。\nHero核原ID/Tag/deadline/Binding保存有限请求，不续期或自动取消占位。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 675,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "freed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 原实例结束→ASC NotifyAbilityEnded。\n先摘原组登记，再native通知；返回后组仍空才OnAbilityGroupFreed。\nHero核原请求后Queue完整Retry，由唯一Process再尝试；组空不是Completed，原Busy期间不立即重开同实例。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "tag",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Spec请求→一次受控native Try / QueryOnly预检"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "tag",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "group",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "原GAS/Tag检查通过→唯一组规则"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "group",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "allow",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Can通过→实际Notify身份/预留→ActiveCount++后的终检"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "group",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "reject",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "真实阻断/占组→本次失败来源"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "reject",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "freed",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "仅Queued有限请求等待占位真实结束；不自动取消"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "freed",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "原ID/Tag/期限有效→Queue完整Retry→唯一Process受控Try"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7-original-active-end-group-freed",
      "fromNode": "allow",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "freed",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "原激活结束进入ASC原Ended；终止完成另等全退出"
    }
  ]
}
